{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Tissa (2nd)","html":"<article id='thag1.97'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.97 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.97 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dasamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Ten </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Tissattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Tissa (2nd) </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Hitvā satapalaṁ kaṁsaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Giving up a hundred ounces of bronze, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sovaṇṇaṁ satarājikaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>and a hundred grains of gold, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Aggahiṁ mattikāpattaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I took a bowl made of clay: </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Idaṁ dutiyābhisecanan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>this is my second initiation. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Tisso thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
